{"seq":1,"slug":"dplyr-data-manipulation","title":"dplyr 数据操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/dplyr-data-manipulation","wordCount":1030,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"dplyr-数据操作\">dplyr 数据操作</h1><p>dplyr 用五个核心动词（filter、select、mutate、summarise、arrange）加上分组操作（group_by）构成了数据操作的完整语义。2026 年 2 月发布的 dplyr 1.2 新增了 <code>filter_out()</code>、<code>when_any()</code>/<code>when_all()</code> 和 <code>case_when()</code> 家族扩展，进一步收紧了「一个动词一个意图」的设计哲学。管道运算符让这些动词可以像句子一样从左到右阅读——数据流入、变换、流出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>一个动词一个意图</strong>：filter/select/mutate/summarise/arrange 各自只负责一类变换，<code>group_by()</code> 提供分组上下文而不直接产出结果。</li>\n<li><strong>动词与 SQL 子句一一对应</strong>：<code>filter</code>→<code>WHERE</code>、<code>select</code>→<code>SELECT</code>、<code>summarise</code>→<code>GROUP BY</code>+聚合、<code>arrange</code>→<code>ORDER BY</code>。</li>\n<li><strong><code>across()</code> 把&quot;对多列做同一件事&quot;变成一次调用</strong>，配合 tidyselect 选择器（<code>starts_with()</code>/<code>where()</code>/<code>everything()</code>）批量施加变换。</li>\n<li><strong>连接族覆盖六种保留语义</strong>：left/right/inner/full 决定保留哪些行，semi/anti 只做存在性过滤而不增殖列。</li>\n<li><strong>窗口函数保持行数不变</strong>，在分组内逐行计算，与 <code>summarise()</code> 的&quot;每组一行&quot;形成对照。</li>\n<li><strong><code>rowwise()</code> 把行当作组</strong>，让 <code>max()</code>、<code>mean()</code> 这类汇总函数可以逐行工作。</li>\n<li><strong>大数据集上可换后端而不换语法</strong>：dtplyr 翻译为 data.table，dbplyr 翻译为 SQL。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"核心动词体系\">核心动词体系</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>动词</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>SQL 等价</th>\n<th>输入</th>\n<th>输出</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>filter()</code></td>\n<td>保留满足条件的行</td>\n<td><code>WHERE</code></td>\n<td>data.frame</td>\n<td>data.frame（行子集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>select()</code></td>\n<td>选择/重命名列</td>\n<td><code>SELECT</code></td>\n<td>data.frame</td>\n<td>data.frame（列子集）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>mutate()</code></td>\n<td>添加/修改列</td>\n<td>计算字段</td>\n<td>data.frame</td>\n<td>data.frame（同行数）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>summarise()</code></td>\n<td>聚合为摘要</td>\n<td><code>GROUP BY</code> + 聚合</td>\n<td>grouped_df</td>\n<td>data.frame（每组一行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>arrange()</code></td>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td><code>ORDER BY</code></td>\n<td>data.frame</td>\n<td>data.frame（重排行）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>group_by()</code></td>\n<td>设定分组上下文</td>\n<td><code>GROUP BY</code></td>\n<td>data.frame</td>\n<td>grouped_df</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"library(dplyr)&#10;&#10;penguins |&gt;&#10;  filter(species == &quot;Adelie&quot;, !is.na(bill_length_mm)) |&gt;&#10;  group_by(island) |&gt;&#10;  summarise(&#10;    n = n(),&#10;    mean_bill = mean(bill_length_mm),&#10;    sd_bill = sd(bill_length_mm)&#10;  ) |&gt;&#10;  arrange(desc(mean_bill))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>library(dplyr)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>penguins |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(species == \"Adelie\", !is.na(bill_length_mm)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(island) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  summarise(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    n = n(),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    mean_bill = mean(bill_length_mm),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    sd_bill = sd(bill_length_mm)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  arrange(desc(mean_bill))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"dplyr-1-2-新特性\">dplyr 1.2 新特性</h2><h3 id=\"filter_out-声明要丢弃的行\"><code>filter_out()</code> — 声明要丢弃的行</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 旧方式：需要取反 + 处理 NA&#10;df |&gt; filter(count != 0 | is.na(count))&#10;&#10;# 新方式：直接声明要排除什么&#10;df |&gt; filter_out(count == 0)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 旧方式：需要取反 + 处理 NA</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> filter(count != 0 | is.na(count))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 新方式：直接声明要排除什么</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> filter_out(count == 0)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>filter_out()</code> 不丢弃 <code>NA</code> 行——这是关键的语义差异。当条件为 <code>NA</code> 时，<code>filter()</code> 丢弃该行，但 <code>filter_out()</code> 保留它。</p>\n<h3 id=\"when_any-when_all-逐元素逻辑组合\"><code>when_any()</code> / <code>when_all()</code> — 逐元素逻辑组合</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# when_any：任一条件为真则保留（等价于 |）&#10;countries |&gt;&#10;  filter(when_any(&#10;    name %in% c(&quot;US&quot;, &quot;CA&quot;) &amp; between(score, 200, 300),&#10;    name %in% c(&quot;PR&quot;, &quot;RU&quot;) &amp; between(score, 100, 200)&#10;  ))&#10;&#10;# when_all：所有条件都为真才保留（等价于 &amp;）&#10;df |&gt; filter(when_all(x &gt; 0, y &gt; 0, z &gt; 0))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># when_any：任一条件为真则保留（等价于 |）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>countries |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(when_any(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name %in% c(\"US\", \"CA\") &#x26; between(score, 200, 300),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    name %in% c(\"PR\", \"RU\") &#x26; between(score, 100, 200)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># when_all：所有条件都为真才保留（等价于 &#x26;）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> filter(when_all(x > 0, y > 0, z > 0))</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"case_when-家族扩展\"><code>case_when()</code> 家族扩展</h3><p>dplyr 1.2 将 <code>case_when()</code> 扩展为四个相关函数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# case_when — 基于条件创建新向量&#10;df |&gt; mutate(&#10;  category = case_when(&#10;    score &gt;= 90 ~ &quot;优&quot;,&#10;    score &gt;= 70 ~ &quot;良&quot;,&#10;    score &gt;= 60 ~ &quot;及格&quot;,&#10;    .default = &quot;不及格&quot;&#10;  )&#10;)&#10;&#10;# replace_when — 条件性更新已有向量&#10;df |&gt; mutate(score = replace_when(score, score &lt; 0 ~ 0, score &gt; 100 ~ 100))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># case_when — 基于条件创建新向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  category = case_when(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    score >= 90 ~ \"优\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    score >= 70 ~ \"良\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    score >= 60 ~ \"及格\",</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    .default = \"不及格\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># replace_when — 条件性更新已有向量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> mutate(score = replace_when(score, score &#x3C; 0 ~ 0, score > 100 ~ 100))</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"across-多列操作\"><code>across()</code> 多列操作</h2><p><code>across()</code> 在 <code>mutate()</code> 和 <code>summarise()</code> 内对多列统一施加变换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 对所有数值列计算均值和标准差&#10;penguins |&gt;&#10;  summarise(across(&#10;    where(is.numeric),&#10;    list(mean = \\(x) mean(x, na.rm = TRUE),&#10;         sd = \\(x) sd(x, na.rm = TRUE))&#10;  ))&#10;&#10;# 对特定列做类型转换&#10;df |&gt; mutate(across(starts_with(&quot;date_&quot;), as.Date))&#10;&#10;# 对多列同时应用条件&#10;df |&gt; filter(if_all(starts_with(&quot;score_&quot;), \\(x) x &gt; 60))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 对所有数值列计算均值和标准差</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>penguins |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  summarise(across(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    where(is.numeric),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    list(mean = \\(x) mean(x, na.rm = TRUE),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>         sd = \\(x) sd(x, na.rm = TRUE))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 对特定列做类型转换</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> mutate(across(starts_with(\"date_\"), as.Date))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 对多列同时应用条件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> filter(if_all(starts_with(\"score_\"), \\(x) x > 60))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>across()</code> 的列选择器支持 tidyselect 语法：<code>starts_with()</code>、<code>ends_with()</code>、<code>contains()</code>、<code>matches()</code>、<code>where()</code>、<code>everything()</code>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"连接操作-joins\">连接操作（Joins）</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[left_join] --&gt;|&quot;保留左表全部行&quot;| B[结果]&#10;    C[right_join] --&gt;|&quot;保留右表全部行&quot;| B&#10;    D[inner_join] --&gt;|&quot;仅保留匹配行&quot;| B&#10;    E[full_join] --&gt;|&quot;保留两表全部行&quot;| B&#10;    F[semi_join] --&gt;|&quot;左表中有匹配的行&quot;| B&#10;    G[anti_join] --&gt;|&quot;左表中无匹配的行&quot;| B\">graph LR\n    A[left_join] --&gt;|\"保留左表全部行\"| B[结果]\n    C[right_join] --&gt;|\"保留右表全部行\"| B\n    D[inner_join] --&gt;|\"仅保留匹配行\"| B\n    E[full_join] --&gt;|\"保留两表全部行\"| B\n    F[semi_join] --&gt;|\"左表中有匹配的行\"| B\n    G[anti_join] --&gt;|\"左表中无匹配的行\"| B</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"orders &lt;- tibble(&#10;  order_id = 1:5,&#10;  customer_id = c(&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;C&quot;, &quot;A&quot;, &quot;D&quot;)&#10;)&#10;customers &lt;- tibble(&#10;  customer_id = c(&quot;A&quot;, &quot;B&quot;, &quot;E&quot;),&#10;  name = c(&quot;Alice&quot;, &quot;Bob&quot;, &quot;Eve&quot;)&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 保留所有订单，匹配客户信息&#10;left_join(orders, customers, by = &quot;customer_id&quot;)&#10;&#10;# 多键连接&#10;left_join(x, y, by = c(&quot;year&quot;, &quot;month&quot;))&#10;&#10;# 不等式连接（dplyr 1.1+）&#10;left_join(x, y, by = join_by(date &gt;= start_date, date &lt;= end_date))\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>orders &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  order_id = 1:5,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  customer_id = c(\"A\", \"B\", \"C\", \"A\", \"D\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>customers &#x3C;- tibble(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  customer_id = c(\"A\", \"B\", \"E\"),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name = c(\"Alice\", \"Bob\", \"Eve\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 保留所有订单，匹配客户信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>left_join(orders, customers, by = \"customer_id\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 多键连接</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>left_join(x, y, by = c(\"year\", \"month\"))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 不等式连接（dplyr 1.1+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>left_join(x, y, by = join_by(date >= start_date, date &#x3C;= end_date))</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>join_by()</code> 支持不等式连接、滚动连接和重叠连接——这是 dplyr 1.1 引入的强大特性。</p>\n<h2 id=\"窗口函数\">窗口函数</h2><p>窗口函数在分组内对每行计算，保持原始行数：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"df |&gt;&#10;  group_by(department) |&gt;&#10;  mutate(&#10;    rank = row_number(desc(salary)),&#10;    pct_rank = percent_rank(salary),&#10;    cumulative = cumsum(revenue),&#10;    lag_revenue = lag(revenue, n = 1),&#10;    lead_revenue = lead(revenue, n = 1),&#10;    moving_avg = slider::slide_dbl(revenue, mean, .before = 2)&#10;  )\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>df |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  group_by(department) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    rank = row_number(desc(salary)),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pct_rank = percent_rank(salary),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    cumulative = cumsum(revenue),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lag_revenue = lag(revenue, n = 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lead_revenue = lead(revenue, n = 1),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    moving_avg = slider::slide_dbl(revenue, mean, .before = 2)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  )</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>排序</td>\n<td><code>row_number()</code>, <code>min_rank()</code>, <code>dense_rank()</code></td>\n<td>不同并列处理方式</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>百分位</td>\n<td><code>percent_rank()</code>, <code>cume_dist()</code>, <code>ntile()</code></td>\n<td>分位数划分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏移</td>\n<td><code>lag()</code>, <code>lead()</code></td>\n<td>前/后 n 行</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>累积</td>\n<td><code>cumsum()</code>, <code>cummean()</code>, <code>cummax()</code></td>\n<td>累积计算</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"rowwise-行级计算\"><code>rowwise()</code> 行级计算</h2><p>当需要逐行而非逐列计算时，<code>rowwise()</code> 将每行视为独立组：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"df &lt;- tibble(x = 1:3, y = 4:6, z = 7:9)&#10;&#10;# 每行计算三列的最大值&#10;df |&gt;&#10;  rowwise() |&gt;&#10;  mutate(max_val = max(c_across(everything()))) |&gt;&#10;  ungroup()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>df &#x3C;- tibble(x = 1:3, y = 4:6, z = 7:9)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 每行计算三列的最大值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  rowwise() |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(max_val = max(c_across(everything()))) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ungroup()</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>c_across()</code> 在 rowwise 上下文中收集指定列的值为向量，让 <code>max()</code>、<code>mean()</code> 等汇总函数逐行工作。</p>\n<h2 id=\"relocate-列位置调整\"><code>relocate()</code> 列位置调整</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"# 将 id 列移到最前&#10;df |&gt; relocate(id, .before = everything())&#10;&#10;# 将所有字符列移到末尾&#10;df |&gt; relocate(where(is.character), .after = last_col())\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span># 将 id 列移到最前</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> relocate(id, .before = everything())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span># 将所有字符列移到末尾</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>df |> relocate(where(is.character), .after = last_col())</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"性能考量与替代方案\">性能考量与替代方案</h2><p>dplyr 的设计优先考虑可读性和正确性，但在大数据集上可能不是最快的选择：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>dplyr</th>\n<th>data.table</th>\n<th>备注</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>&lt; 100 万行</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>无明显优势</td>\n<td>语法清晰优先</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>100 万 - 1 亿行</td>\n<td>可用</td>\n<td>2-10x 更快</td>\n<td>内存效率差异显著</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>&gt; 1 亿行</td>\n<td>瓶颈</td>\n<td>推荐</td>\n<td>或使用 Arrow/DuckDB</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分组聚合</td>\n<td>良好</td>\n<td>极优</td>\n<td>data.table 的 GForce 优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>dplyr 可以通过 <code>dtplyr</code>（翻译为 data.table）或 <code>dbplyr</code>（翻译为 SQL）获得后端加速，保持相同的语法界面。关于大数据扩展策略，参见<a href=\"../applications/r-performance-scaling\">R 性能优化与大数据</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战模式-数据清洗管道\">实战模式：数据清洗管道</h2><p>将多个动词组合成完整的清洗流水线：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"r\" data-code=\"clean_data &lt;- raw_data |&gt;&#10;  # 过滤：移除测试数据和异常值&#10;  filter_out(is_test == TRUE) |&gt;&#10;  filter(between(age, 0, 120)) |&gt;&#10;  # 选择：只保留分析需要的列&#10;  select(id, date, age, gender, score, group) |&gt;&#10;  # 变换：标准化和派生&#10;  mutate(&#10;    date = as.Date(date),&#10;    age_group = cut(age, breaks = c(0, 18, 35, 55, Inf),&#10;                    labels = c(&quot;青年&quot;, &quot;中年前&quot;, &quot;中年后&quot;, &quot;老年&quot;)),&#10;    score_z = (score - mean(score, na.rm = TRUE)) / sd(score, na.rm = TRUE)&#10;  ) |&gt;&#10;  # 去重&#10;  distinct(id, date, .keep_all = TRUE) |&gt;&#10;  # 排序&#10;  arrange(id, date)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>clean_data &#x3C;- raw_data |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 过滤：移除测试数据和异常值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter_out(is_test == TRUE) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  filter(between(age, 0, 120)) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 选择：只保留分析需要的列</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  select(id, date, age, gender, score, group) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 变换：标准化和派生</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  mutate(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    date = as.Date(date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    age_group = cut(age, breaks = c(0, 18, 35, 55, Inf),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                    labels = c(\"青年\", \"中年前\", \"中年后\", \"老年\")),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    score_z = (score - mean(score, na.rm = TRUE)) / sd(score, na.rm = TRUE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  ) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 去重</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  distinct(id, date, .keep_all = TRUE) |></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  # 排序</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  arrange(id, date)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这种管道风格让代码的意图一目了然——每一步都是一个可理解的数据变换。对于管道中涉及数据整形（宽转长、长转宽）和函数式迭代的场景，参见<a href=\"tidyr-purrr-pipeline\">tidyr 与 purrr 管道</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>五个核心动词 + <code>group_by()</code> 构成了数据操作的完整语义，管道让数据流从左到右可读。</li>\n<li>dplyr 1.2 的 <code>filter_out()</code> 与 <code>case_when()</code> 家族进一步强化了&quot;一个动词一个意图&quot;的设计，但要注意 <code>filter_out()</code> 不丢弃 <code>NA</code> 行的语义差异。</li>\n<li><code>across()</code> + tidyselect 是批量列操作的标准手段，避免了对列名硬编码。</li>\n<li>连接族中 semi/anti 只做存在性过滤，是不增殖列的正确选择；<code>join_by()</code> 支持不等式与滚动连接。</li>\n<li>窗口函数保持行数、<code>rowwise()</code> 把行视为组，两者覆盖了&quot;逐行&quot;类需求。</li>\n<li>性能上 dplyr 优先可读性，百万行以上应考虑 data.table 后端，亿行以上转向 Arrow/DuckDB。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"dplyr 数据操作","id":"dplyr-数据操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"核心动词体系","id":"核心动词体系"},{"level":2,"text":"dplyr 1.2 新特性","id":"dplyr-1-2-新特性"},{"level":3,"text":"`filter_out()` — 声明要丢弃的行","id":"filter_out-声明要丢弃的行"},{"level":3,"text":"`when_any()` / `when_all()` — 逐元素逻辑组合","id":"when_any-when_all-逐元素逻辑组合"},{"level":3,"text":"`case_when()` 家族扩展","id":"case_when-家族扩展"},{"level":2,"text":"`across()` 多列操作","id":"across-多列操作"},{"level":2,"text":"连接操作（Joins）","id":"连接操作-joins"},{"level":2,"text":"窗口函数","id":"窗口函数"},{"level":2,"text":"`rowwise()` 行级计算","id":"rowwise-行级计算"},{"level":2,"text":"`relocate()` 列位置调整","id":"relocate-列位置调整"},{"level":2,"text":"性能考量与替代方案","id":"性能考量与替代方案"},{"level":2,"text":"实战模式：数据清洗管道","id":"实战模式-数据清洗管道"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"R 包生态与开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/fundamentals/r-package-ecosystem"},"next":{"title":"ggplot2 可视化体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/r-language-data-analysis/tidyverse/ggplot2-visualization"}}